    "Titles": {
        "eng": "Clamp School Detectives",
        "jpn": "CLAMP学園探偵団"
    },
    "Summaries": {
        "eng": "CLAMP School: the ultimate educational institution. Catering exclusively to only the best and the brightest of all ages, it is without equal in Japan and the world. But of the ten thousand students, there are three grade-schoolers in particular who stand out. They are Nokoru Imonoyama, President of the Student Council, Akira Ijuuin, Treasurer, and Suou Takamura, Secretary. Put them together, and they are but six feet tall, thirty-three years old, and... the ultimate mystery solving, crime fighting team?! Strange it may sound, but whenever these pint-sized overachievers see a problem a little sleuthing might fix, they spring into action to save the day. On campus or off, they are a force of good no evildoers can rival. But a simple detective service this is not, for Nokoru has a special goal in mind when he picks his cases. With a practical 'sixth sense' for damsels in distress, this twelve year old shameless romantic will stop at nothing to aid a gentle maiden. However, with Nokoru's vast female fan club always after him, it might be the ladies man and not the ladies that needs saving... Filled with adventure, comedy, and touching friendship, this is one story you don't need Sherlock to solve, for these youngsters can give him a run for his Watson.",
        "jpn": "美少年の3人組を主人公にしたCLAMP原作による同題の人気コミックをアニメ化。「学園特捜デュカリオン」などCLAMPの他作品からもキャラクターが客演している。将来の日本を支える優秀な人材を送り出すため設立された一大学園都市“CLAMP学園”。この初等部学生会役員である会長・妹之山残、書記・鷹村蘇芳、会計・伊集院玲の成績優秀トリオは、女性の悩みを解決する探偵団を結成した。今日も彼らは女性のために学園を駆ける。"
    },
